{
  "about": "Text-agent evaluation set for the MALO BURGER kiosk and, for cases with kioskId \"airport_rail\", the SKYLINE AIRPORT RAIL ticket machine (docs/TESTING.md \"Agent evaluation set\"). Written by the KIBO team, not an external benchmark. Each case starts on a fresh /demo session of its kioskId (default malo; status connected, empty cart) at 14:00 KST. Types follow TESTING 1-6, 8, 9; \"checkout\" checks the confirm rule; \"grounded-reply\" checks that the reply describes items only with menu data (scripts/grounding.ts, I-072). A cart expectation merges identical lines and counts defaults (set side fries_m, drink size m).",
  "notCovered": [
    { "type": "7-count-limits", "reason": "Count limits (max 3 toppings) need the learned Doughhouse kiosk, which has no LearnedAdapter yet." }
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "t1-en-several",
      "type": "1-several-items",
      "locale": "en",
      "turns": ["One cheeseburger, just the burger. Chicken nuggets with honey mustard sauce, and a large cola."],
      "expect": {
        "cart": [
          { "itemId": "cheese_burger", "variant": "single", "qty": 1, "selections": {} },
          { "itemId": "chicken_nuggets", "variant": "single", "qty": 1, "selections": { "sauce": ["honey_mustard"] } },
          { "itemId": "cola", "variant": "single", "qty": 1, "selections": { "size": ["l"] } }
        ]
      }
    },
